---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section
  data-demo="revenue"
  lang={lang}
  data-reset-message={t(
    "Initial assumptions restored.",
    "처음 가정으로 돌아왔습니다.",
    "初期の仮定に戻りました。",
  )}
  data-valid={t(
    "Estimate updated from the current assumptions.",
    "현재 가정으로 추정치를 갱신했습니다.",
    "現在の仮定で見積を更新しました。",
  )}
  data-invalid={t(
    "Enter whole numbers from 0 to 10,000 in every field. The last valid estimate is shown.",
    "모든 항목에 0~10,000 정수를 입력하세요. 마지막 유효 추정치를 표시합니다.",
    "全欄に0〜10,000の整数を入力してください。最後の有効な見積を表示しています。",
  )}
>
  <header>
    <p>
      {t(
        "MAP EXPORTER / FICTIONAL MONTH",
        "지도 출력 도구 / 가상 한 달",
        "地図出力ツール / 架空の1か月",
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "Will this month cover its costs?",
        "이번 달 비용을 충당할까요?",
        "今月の費用を賄える？",
      )}
    </h2>
  </header>
  <div
    class="scenarios"
    role="group"
    aria-label={t("Compare assumptions", "가정 비교", "仮定を比較")}
  >
    <button type="button" data-scenario="0,20,100" data-interactive disabled>
      {t("No paying users", "유료 사용자 0명", "有料利用者0人")}
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-scenario="100,20,100" data-interactive disabled>
      {t("Moderate use", "보통 사용량", "通常の利用量")}
    </button>
    <button
      type="button"
      data-scenario="100,1000,100"
      data-interactive
      disabled
    >
      {t("Heavy use, same price", "같은 가격, 과다 사용", "同じ料金、大量利用")}
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="assumptions">
    <label>
      {t("Paying users", "유료 사용자", "有料利用者")}
      <input
        data-users
        data-interactive
        disabled
        type="number"
        value="100"
        min="0"
        max="10000"
        step="1"
      />
    </label>
    <label>
      {t(
        "Exports per paying user",
        "유료 사용자당 출력 수",
        "有料利用者ごとの出力数",
      )}
      <input
        data-usage
        data-interactive
        disabled
        type="number"
        value="20"
        min="0"
        max="10000"
        step="1"
      />
    </label>
    <label>
      {t("Fixed operating cost", "고정 운영비", "固定運用費")}
      <input
        data-fixed
        data-interactive
        disabled
        type="number"
        value="100"
        min="0"
        max="10000"
        step="1"
      />
    </label>
  </div>
  <p class="rates">
    {t(
      "Fictional currency units: 5 per paying user/month · 0.02 processing cost per export",
      "가상 화폐 단위: 사용자당 월 5 · 출력당 처리 비용 0.02",
      "架空の通貨単位：利用者ごとに月5 · 出力ごとの処理費0.02",
    )}
  </p>
  <dl class="ledger">
    <div>
      <dt>{t("Gross revenue", "총매출", "総売上")}</dt>
      <dd>
        <output data-gross>500.00</output>
        <small data-gross-formula>100 × 5</small>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>{t("Modeled costs", "계산한 비용", "模型内の費用")}</dt>
      <dd>
        <output data-cost>140.00</output>
        <small data-cost-formula>100 + 100 × 20 × 0.02</small>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="remaining">
      <dt>{t("Amount remaining", "남는 금액", "残る金額")}</dt>
      <dd>
        <output data-remaining>360.00</output>
        <small>
          {t(
            "Revenue − modeled costs",
            "매출 − 계산한 비용",
            "売上 − 模型内の費用",
          )}
        </small>
      </dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
  <p>
    {t(
      "A negative amount means these assumptions do not cover the modeled costs. This is not net profit: tax, payment fees, refunds, free-user usage and unlisted work are omitted. No sales are predicted or charged.",
      "음수이면 이 가정으로 계산한 비용을 충당하지 못합니다. 세금·결제 수수료·환불·무료 사용자 사용량·누락 작업을 제외했으므로 순이익이 아닙니다. 판매를 예측하거나 청구하지 않습니다.",
      "負の金額なら、この仮定では計算した費用を賄えません。税・決済手数料・返金・無料利用者の使用量・未記載の作業を除くため純利益ではありません。販売の予測や請求は行いません。",
    )}
  </p>
  <button type="button" data-reset data-interactive disabled>
    {t("Reset", "초기화", "リセット")}
  </button>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</section>
<script>
  import { mount } from "./shared";
  mount("revenue", (root, say) => {
    const inputs = ["users", "usage", "fixed"].map((key) =>
      root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`[data-${key}]`)!,
    );
    const put = (key: string, value: string) => {
      root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-${key}]`)!.textContent = value;
    };
    const update = () => {
      const values = inputs.map((input) => {
        const n = input.valueAsNumber;
        const valid = Number.isInteger(n) && n >= 0 && n <= 10000;
        input.setAttribute("aria-invalid", String(!valid));
        return valid ? n : null;
      });
      if (values.some((v) => v === null)) {
        root.dataset.invalidState = "true";
        say(root.dataset.invalid!);
        return;
      }
      const [users, usage, fixed] = values as number[];
      const grossCents = users * 500,
        costCents = fixed * 100 + users * usage * 2;
      put("gross", (grossCents / 100).toFixed(2));
      put("cost", (costCents / 100).toFixed(2));
      put("remaining", ((grossCents - costCents) / 100).toFixed(2));
      root.dataset.loss = String(grossCents < costCents);
      put("gross-formula", `${users} × 5`);
      put("cost-formula", `${fixed} + ${users} × ${usage} × 0.02`);
      root.dataset.invalidState = "false";
      say(root.dataset.valid!);
    };
    inputs.forEach((input) => input.addEventListener("input", update));
    root
      .querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-scenario]")
      .forEach((button) => {
        button.addEventListener("click", () => {
          button.dataset.scenario!.split(",").forEach((value, i) => {
            inputs[i].value = value;
          });
          update();
        });
      });
    return () => {
      [100, 20, 100].forEach((value, i) => {
        inputs[i].value = String(value);
      });
      update();
    };
  });
</script>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    background: #f8f3e9;
    color: #35352d;
    padding: clamp(18px, 4vw, 36px);
    border: 1px solid #bbb19e;
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  header p {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    margin: 14px 0 28px;
  }
  .assumptions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  label {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  input,
  button {
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
    font: inherit;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 10px;
    background: #fffef9;
    color: #35352d;
    border: 1px solid #7e7869;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  input {
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  button {
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  input:disabled,
  button:disabled {
    opacity: 0.65;
    cursor: default;
  }
  :focus-visible {
    outline: 3px dashed #6b4b92;
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
  input[aria-invalid="true"] {
    border: 2px solid #ac3023;
  }
  .rates {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #bbb19e;
  }
  .ledger {
    margin: 25px 0;
  }
  .ledger > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #bbb19e;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .ledger dd {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .ledger output {
    display: block;
    font: 700 clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.4rem) monospace;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .ledger small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .remaining {
    border-bottom: 3px double #4f5749 !important;
  }
  .remaining output {
    color: #315339;
  }
  section > p {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }
  [role="status"] {
    min-height: 1.6em;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  section[data-invalid-state="true"] .ledger {
    border-left: 4px solid #ac3023;
    padding-left: 12px;
  }
  @container (width < 540px) {
    .assumptions {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .ledger > div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 5px;
    }
    .ledger dd {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    section {
      background: Canvas;
      color: CanvasText;
    }
    input,
    button {
      background: Canvas;
      color: CanvasText;
      border-color: CanvasText;
    }
    :focus-visible {
      outline-color: Highlight;
    }
    .remaining output {
      color: CanvasText;
    }
  }

  .scenarios {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .scenarios button {
    flex: 1 1 140px;
    border-width: 2px;
    padding: 18px;
  }
  .ledger .remaining {
    border: 5px solid #35513a;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .remaining output {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7cqi, 4rem);
  }
  section[data-loss="true"] .remaining {
    color: #792a2a;
    background: #fff4f0;
    border-color: #792a2a;
  }
</style>
